        "comments": "The assembly lsCroTomm1.hap1.1 is based on 29x PacBio data and Arima2 Hi-C data generated by the Darwin Tree of Life Project\n(https://www.darwintreeoflife.org/). The assembly process included the following sequence of steps: initial PacBio assembly generation with Hifiasm in Hi-C integrated assembly mode, and Hi-C based scaffolding with YaHS. The mitochondrial and chloroplast genomes were assembled using OATK. Finally, each haplotype assembly was analysed and manually improved using TreeVal. Chromosome-scale scaffolds confirmed by the Hi-C data have been named in order of size. Heterozygous inversions were observed in this assembly at the following locations: Chromosome 1\n89.4-106.1 Mbp, Chromosome 3\n81.1-87.9 and\n94.7-97.4 Mbp, Chromosome 5\n71.1-80 Mbp, Chromosome 6\n85.5-88.5 and\n99-107 Mbp.",
